# sevarbg.com/new  ->  new SEVAR site running in Docker on the VPS
#
# Upload this file to the SuperHosting cPanel as:   public_html/new/.htaccess
#   (File Manager -> public_html -> + Folder "new" -> Upload -> rename to .htaccess)
# Replace VPS_IP below with the VPS address. On the VPS, .env must contain BASE_PATH=/new and the container
# must be reachable on port 24917 (BIND_ADDR=0.0.0.0, firewall open for 24917).
#
# This folder's rules replace WordPress' rules for everything under /new, so the old site is untouched.
# Needs mod_proxy + mod_proxy_http on the hosting. If /new shows "500 Internal Server Error", the host does not
# allow proxying from .htaccess — use the subdomain route in README.md (new.sevarbg.com) instead.

Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex disabled

RewriteEngine On
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ http://VPS_IP:24917/new/$1 [P,L,QSA]
